├── notebooks/ # Model training notebooks
├── models/ # (Ignored - stored externally)
├── app.py # Main application
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md


---

## 📊 Dataset

- Contains packaging materials, cost, and sustainability metrics  
- Used for training and evaluating ML models  
- Includes real-world inspired environmental parameters  

---

## 🤖 Machine Learning Approach

- Data preprocessing and feature engineering  
- Model training using classification/regression techniques  
- Evaluation using accuracy and performance metrics  
- Optimization for better recommendations  

